id: pm-vcs-verification-contracts
title: Preserve verification accounting and checkpoint refusal contracts
description: "Review threads PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6yWzcX and PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6yWzck identify valid general SDK reporting/compatibility gaps: checkpoint IO/budget failures now use VerificationRefusal rather than checkpoint-specific refusal guidance, and closure checked currently equals successfully verified nodes rather than attempted inspections. Both remain fail-closed and do not authorize unsafe pack/erasure behavior. Repair the result/refusal contracts separately without weakening verification or changing old read/export support."
